## 4. Standar Desain Tombol (Buttons) & Badge / Tagging Sistem (Luxury Gold & Obsidian Slate)

Wajib menjaga keseragaman seluruh elemen interaktif sistem sesuai tema brand **Luxury Gold & Obsidian Slate**:

### A. Aturan Tombol Aksi (Buttons)
1. **Tombol Aksi Utama / Primary CTA (Submit, Simpan, Konfirmasi, Tambah Mitra, Upgrade, Tarik Saldo):**
   - **Varian 1 (Metallic Gold Gradient):**
     ```html
     class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#B8922E] via-[#D4AF37] to-[#F3E5AB] hover:opacity-95 active:scale-[0.99] text-slate-950 font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider py-3.5 px-6 rounded-2xl shadow-md transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50"
     ```
   - **Varian 2 (Obsidian Slate Dark dengan Aksen Emas):**
     ```html
     class="bg-[#0F172A] hover:bg-slate-800 active:scale-[0.99] text-[#D4AF37] font-extrabold text-xs py-3 px-5 rounded-2xl shadow-md border border-[#D4AF37]/30 transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"
     ```
2. **Tombol Sekunder / Batal / Filter:**
   - Gunakan `bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 font-bold text-xs rounded-xl py-2.5 px-4 transition-colors` atau `border border-slate-300 bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 text-slate-700`.
3. **⛔ LARANGAN KERAS (Anti-Green Button Rule):**
   - **DILARANG MENGGUNAKAN** tombol warna hijau polos / generic (`bg-emerald-600`, `bg-green-500`, `bg-emerald-500`, dsb.) untuk tombol submit, simpan, aktivasi, pendaftaran mitra, withdrawal, maupun aksi formulir. Hijau hanya untuk indikator icon success kecil atau chat WhatsApp eksternal.

### B. Aturan Badge, Label, dan Section Header
1. **Section Header / Card Group Badge:**
   ```html
   <div class="text-[11px] font-black tracking-wider text-[#D4AF37] uppercase flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-slate-200/60 pb-2">
   ```
2. **Badge & Status Label:**
   - **Gold Badge:** `bg-[#faf6eb] text-[#B8922E] border border-[#D4AF37]/30 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full`
   - **Obsidian Badge:** `bg-slate-900 text-[#D4AF37] border border-slate-800 text-[10px] font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full`
   - **DILARANG** menggunakan background atau border hijau generic (`border-emerald-400 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700`) untuk card border, field group border, atau badge keterangan formulir.

---

## 5. Kualitas Kode, CI/CD & Standar Pemrograman

1. **Clean & Maintainable:** Terapkan prinsip DRY (Don't Repeat Yourself) dan KISS (Keep It Simple, Stupid).
2. **Strict DB Transactions:** Semua perhitungan bonus rekrut, royalty cluster, pembagian 4 post saldo, auto-upgrade, dan royalty transaksi **WAJIB dibungkus dalam `DB::transaction()`**.
3. **Service Layer & Form Request:** Pisahkan validasi input ke Form Request / Controller validation yang jelas dan logika perhitungan bisnis ke `App\Services\UccBonusService`.
4. **Automated Testing & CI/CD:** Setiap perubahan bisnis logic wajib disertai Feature/Unit test di `tests/` dan lolos pipeline GitHub Actions (`.github/workflows/ci.yml`).
5. **UI Consistency:** Gunakan Tailwind CSS dengan palet gold/dark slate yang konsisten, komponen dialog/modal yang responsif, dan feedback interaksi yang jelas.

---

